{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "875eacfd86fd72cf7d5e42d4d74d30e7418435062d571e3c0b1b9bd97d737e3c", "ja": "（先日、アイドルのみんなが出演したお正月特番の\n資料用映像が届いた。控え室に誰かいるかな……）", "zh": "（前几天，偶像们参加的新年特别节目资料影像送来了。休息室里不知道有没有人……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a6ab1b8535a6ec91ba35069a7fc21c06a1d7427684c21d0099e3403e0701868d", "ja": "あ、いたいた。莉緒、お疲れさま！\nちょうど良かった。", "zh": "啊，找到你了。莉绪，辛苦了！\n来得正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "4937d75c9f352a7dec488a187afcda22c069322586504d097e9d17a3d919283a", "ja": "あら、{$P$}くん。ちょうどって、\nどうかしたの？　もしかして……デートのお誘い？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}。说什么正好，\n怎么了吗？难不成……是想约我出去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1bec94497b73fbcbecbdc42ed4dc6cfe4c8817781d925bbca61551fe4be4e520", "ja": "違う違う。お正月特番の資料用映像が\n届いたんだけど、莉緒も見たいんじゃないかと思って。", "zh": "不对不对。新年特别节目的资料影像送到了，我想莉绪应该也想看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "dcd927d71110f2a8ec7f182c10bf8a22cb7ea3d5c2094b6e867fff0e05e35fbf", "ja": "お正月特番……あっ、かくし芸ね？\nもちろん見るわよ！", "zh": "新年特别节目……啊，是才艺表演吧？\n当然要看啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "2bae129883a5112ba024ef6960e31535a30e6bfae12bec6d799fa32d8398e223", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}くんから見て、\nあの時の私……どうだったかしら？", "zh": "对了对了，在{$P$}看来，那时候的我……表现得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1006_p", "source_sha256": "13f462c228969f55b3c182419decf23bfc88ce0916cfdc46b66595eda85ac60a", "ja": "あの時の莉緒……そうだな。流石、\n優勝するだけあって、すごいアクションだったよ。", "zh": "那时的莉绪……让我想想。真不愧是\n拿了冠军的人，动作戏非常精彩哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "d077c7996c149fa9ce79647e4d4d9cd03d420d5617a1ebc091fea21fec4a9c85", "ja": "そうそう♪　エージェントとして、襲ってくる\n黒服達をばったばったとなぎ倒していって……。", "zh": "对对♪作为特工，把袭击过来的黑衣人一个个统统打倒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "7ff7408c314603c14ea5b9347290095413f53fa0e4b50a00298ffaeb9640bbcd", "ja": "って、もう！　そうじゃなくて！", "zh": "真是的！不是说这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "712ae2462381846acfe34ee5e9eaca549d74a22f9cb236300201039c2a8f9d13", "ja": "アクションをほめてくれるのはうれしいけど、\nもっと他に言うことがあるんじゃないの？", "zh": "你夸我的动作，我是很高兴啦，可是就没有别的什么要说了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7661fd09839d4a47665cdb455f438c8b2da226b1238980bf687cdb91c565be8d", "ja": "他に言うこと……というと？", "zh": "你说的其他方面……是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "30e10ccbd46c8746fa6814e2737d93cd6f48f40e42fbd02d76060d04394ad789", "ja": "ほらぁ、たとえば私が着てた衣装とか！\nセクシーな女エージェント、最高だったでしょ？", "zh": "你看，比如我穿过的服装之类的！\n性感女特工，超棒的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9918b6eb199c37fa340a2a3f6b5de8774bb936bb27215c64188ae3c32e46cec5", "ja": "ああ、なるほど……確かにあの衣装は、莉緒に\nよく似合ってたよ。大人の魅力というか……。", "zh": "啊，原来如此……确实，那套服装很适合莉绪。该说是成熟女人的魅力吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "b2b3094095d9ced2eddb2c9431dde84f212d0b5d308099f02abe2d10fbc451f8", "ja": "ふふっ、そうそう♪　{$P$}くん、\nちゃんとわかってるんじゃないの♪", "zh": "呵呵，对对♪{$P$}，看来你确实很懂嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "3027f756e8353d32dd651d16c20b5cb7109a17fc0a1dd8de04303d3018a8f62e", "ja": "足のラインがキレイにでる衣装だったから、ファンの\nみんなにも、たっぷりサービスできたと思うのよね。", "zh": "因为这套服装能很好地展现腿部线条，我想也让粉丝们大饱眼福了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c7538dd53e2bfaf431cbf521d4d3ae48dd0ad61b1a0f4ce5f05b360151f14694", "ja": "そうだな。それに、優勝カップを渡されて\n涙ぐむシーンも、ギャップがあって良かったと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。而且，接过优胜奖杯时眼含泪光的那一幕，也很有反差感，我觉得很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "b1a327531bac1fd0d22eb71c03a8af7ad4ae561efe18ee86c406e213b1edf4b5", "ja": "あ、あれは……正直、恥ずかしかったのよ？\nメイクだって、崩れちゃってたし……。", "zh": "啊、那个……说实话，我觉得挺丢脸的。\n妆也都哭花了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e230f367ffd6cb3e1de59209f4660af05a37ab66aab551bf8d5f3f21b7b34a59", "ja": "気にしすぎだと思うけど……\n感動的だったし、見所のひとつだと思うな。", "zh": "我觉得你太在意了……\n不过确实很感人，我觉得也是一大看点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "e5860c73d98fc2076289a2034ee3169a10c96a597ed8565e6a46710d3d45ed41", "ja": "み、見所！？　そんな、パンダ目だったのに……！\n今からでもそのシーン、差し替えられないかしら？", "zh": "看、看点！？怎么会，我那时候都哭成熊猫眼了……！\n现在开始还能不能把那个场景替换掉呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "956c3453fad47abddf5141e8e3ca6b624f2e968f56579d5ebf08c83551cf2d60", "ja": "あ、泣き顔を見られたのがイヤなわけじゃないのよ？\nただ、メイクが崩れちゃってるのは絶対ダメなの～！", "zh": "啊，我不是讨厌被看到哭泣的样子哦？\n只是妆花掉了绝对不行啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0143_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "516ac5e0bc6d9af25f03ee0b753eab5576eadcd7f12579405a42af71536c5233", "ja": "{$P$}くん、やっぱり今から差し替え\nお願いしましょ？　ねえ聞いてる？　ねえってばー！", "zh": "{$P$}，果然还是拜托现在替换一下吧？喂，你听到了吗？喂——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
